[{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Write down the exponential form of each of these, giving your answer:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech x=\\frac2{e^x-e^{-x}}=\\frac{2e^x}{e^{2x}-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech x=\\frac2{e^x+e^{-x}}=\\frac{2e^x}{e^{2x}+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth x=\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{e^x-e^{-x}}=\\frac{e^{2x}+1}{e^{2x}-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Write down the exact value of each of these in terms of exponentials, and then to 3 significant figures:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech 1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech 1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech(-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech(-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech1=\\frac2{e-e^{-1}}=0.851\\text{ (3 SF)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech1=\\frac2{e+e^{-1}}=0.648\\text{ (3 SF)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech(-1)=\\frac2{e^{-1}-e}=-0.851\\text{ (3 SF)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech(-1)=\\frac2{e^{-1}+e}=0.648\\text{ (3 SF)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech(-x)=-\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech(-x) \\equiv\\frac2{e^{-x}-e^{-(-x)}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{e^{-x}-e^x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{-(e^x-e^{-x})}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\frac2{e^x-e^{-x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\cosech x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech(-x)=\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech(-x) \\equiv\\frac2{e^{-x}+e^{-(-x)}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{e^{-x}+e^x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{e^x+e^{-x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\sech x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>By using the exponential forms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find a simplified exact value for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech(\\ln3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech(\\ln6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech(\\ln\\sqrt5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech(4\\ln3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech(\\ln3) \\equiv\\frac2{e^{\\ln3}-e^{-\\ln3}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{e^{\\ln3}-e^{\\ln(1/3)}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{3-\\frac13}=\\frac34.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech(\\ln6) \\equiv\\frac2{e^{\\ln6}+e^{-\\ln6}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{6+\\frac16}=\\frac{12}{37}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech(\\ln\\sqrt5) \\equiv\\frac2{e^{\\ln\\sqrt5}-e^{-\\ln\\sqrt5}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{\\sqrt5-\\frac1{\\sqrt5}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt5}{5-1}=\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech(4\\ln3) \\equiv\\frac2{e^{4\\ln3}+e^{-4\\ln3}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{e^{\\ln81}+e^{\\ln(1/81)}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac2{81+\\frac1{81}}=\\frac{81}{3281}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech(\\ln k)=\\dfrac{2k}{k^2-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech(\\ln k) =\\frac2{e^{\\ln k}-e^{-\\ln k}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac2{e^{\\ln k}-e^{\\ln(1/k)}}=\\frac2{k-1/k}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2k}{k^2-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech(3\\ln k)=\\dfrac{2k^3}{k^6+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech(3\\ln k) =\\frac2{e^{3\\ln k}+e^{-3\\ln k}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac2{e^{\\ln k^3}+e^{\\ln(1/k^3)}}=\\frac2{k^3+1/k^3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2k^3}{k^6+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\cosech(2\\ln x)-\\sech(2\\ln x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\ne k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for some constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Explain why <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{4x^2}{(x^4-1)(x^4+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf(1) =\\cosech(2\\ln1)-\\sech(2\\ln1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\cosech0-\\sech0=\\frac1{\\sinh0}-\\frac1{\\cosh0}=\\frac10-\\frac11.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is undefined when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf(x) =\\cosech(2\\ln x)-\\sech(2\\ln x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac2{e^{2\\ln x}-e^{-2\\ln x}}-\\frac2{e^{2\\ln x}+e^{-2\\ln x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac2{x^2-x^{-2}}-\\frac2{x^2+x^{-2}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2x^2}{x^4-1}-\\frac{2x^2}{x^4+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2x^2(x^4+1)-2x^2(x^4-1)}{(x^4-1)(x^4+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2x^6+2x^2-2x^6+2x^2}{(x^4-1)(x^4+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{4x^2}{(x^4-1)(x^4+1)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>By using the exponential forms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=\\dfrac{e^{2x}+1}{(e^x+1)(e^x-1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth x \\equiv\\frac{\\cosh x}{\\sinh x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{(e^x+e^{-x})/2}{(e^x-e^{-x})/2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{e^x-e^{-x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+1}{e^{2x}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+1}{(e^x+1)(e^x-1)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>By using the exponential forms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find a simplified exact value for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth(\\ln2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth(\\ln\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth\\left(\\frac14\\ln8\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth(\\ln2) \\equiv\\frac{e^{2\\ln2}+1}{e^{2\\ln2}-1}=\\frac{e^{\\ln4}+1}{e^{\\ln4}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{4+1}{4-1}=\\frac53.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth(\\ln\\sqrt2) \\equiv\\frac{e^{2\\ln\\sqrt2}+1}{e^{2\\ln\\sqrt2}-1}=\\frac{e^{\\ln2}+1}{e^{\\ln2}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{2+1}{2-1}=3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth\\left(\\frac14\\ln8\\right) \\equiv\\frac{e^{2\\times\\frac14\\ln8}+1}{e^{2\\times\\frac14\\ln8}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^{\\frac12\\ln8}+1}{e^{\\frac12\\ln8}-1}=\\frac{\\sqrt8+1}{\\sqrt8-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2\\sqrt2+1}{2\\sqrt2-1}\\times\\frac{2\\sqrt2+1}{2\\sqrt2+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{9+4\\sqrt2}{7}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth(-x)=-\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth(-x) \\equiv\\frac{e^{2(-x)}+1}{e^{2(-x)}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^{-2x}+1}{e^{-2x}-1}=\\frac{1+e^{2x}}{1-e^{2x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+1}{-(e^{2x}-1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\frac{e^{2x}+1}{e^{2x}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\coth x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Find a simplified exact value for each of these:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth(-\\ln3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth(-5\\ln2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth(-\\ln3) \\equiv-\\coth(\\ln3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\frac{e^{2\\ln3}+1}{e^{2\\ln3}-1}=-\\frac{e^{\\ln9}+1}{e^{\\ln9}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\frac{9+1}{9-1}=-\\frac54.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth(-5\\ln2) \\equiv-\\coth(5\\ln2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\frac{e^{10\\ln2}+1}{e^{10\\ln2}-1}=-\\frac{e^{\\ln1024}+1}{e^{\\ln1024}-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv-\\frac{1024+1}{1024-1}=-\\frac{1025}{1023}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=-\\frac15\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech x=1 \\Rightarrow\\sinh x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2+1})=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech x=2 \\Rightarrow\\sinh x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\sqrt{(\\frac12)^2+1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech x=-\\frac15 \\Rightarrow\\sinh x=-5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\ln\\left(-5+\\sqrt{(-5)^2+1}\\right)=\\ln(-5+\\sqrt{26}).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech x=1 \\Rightarrow\\cosh x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2-1})=\\ln1=0.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech x=\\frac12 \\Rightarrow\\cosh x=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\ln(2+\\sqrt{2^2-1})=\\pm\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln(2\\pm\\sqrt3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech x=\\frac23 \\Rightarrow\\cosh x=\\frac32\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\ln\\left(\\frac32+\\sqrt{(\\frac32)^2-1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\pm\\ln\\left(\\frac32+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)=\\pm\\ln\\left(\\frac{3+\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac{3\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=-\\frac53\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth x=2 \\Rightarrow\\tanh x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\frac12}{1-\\frac12}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth x=\\frac32 \\Rightarrow\\tanh x=\\frac23\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\frac23}{1-\\frac23}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln5.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth x=-\\frac53 \\Rightarrow\\tanh x=-\\frac35\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1-\\frac35}{1+\\frac35}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln\\frac14\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac12\\ln4=-\\ln2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\sech x-2\\tanh x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8\\cosech x-3\\coth x=27\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\tanh x-5\\coth x=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n5\\sech x-2\\tanh x=5 \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac5{\\cosh x}-\\frac{2\\sinh x}{\\cosh x} =5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow5-2\\sinh x =5\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2\\sinh x+5\\cosh x =5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2+5\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}2 =5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2(e^x-e^{-x})+5(e^x+e^{-x}) =10\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow7e^x+3e^{-x} =10\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow7e^{2x}-10e^x+3 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(7e^x-3)(e^x-1) =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^x=\\frac37\\text{ or }e^x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x =\\ln\\frac37\\text{ or }x=0.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n8\\cosech x-3\\coth x=27 \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac8{\\sinh x}-\\frac{3\\cosh x}{\\sinh x} =27\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow27\\sinh x+3\\cosh x =8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow27\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2+3\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}2 =8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow30e^x-24e^{-x} =16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow15e^{2x}-8e^x-12 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(3e^x+2)(5e^x-6) =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^x=-\\frac23\\text{ or }e^x=\\frac65.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^x=-\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has no real solutions; <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^x=\\frac65\\Rightarrow x=\\ln\\frac65\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2\\tanh x-5\\coth x=9 \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2\\tanh x-\\frac5{\\tanh x} =9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2\\tanh^2x-9\\tanh x-5 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(2\\tanh x+1)(\\tanh x-5) =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\tanh x=-\\frac12\\text{ or }\\tanh x=5.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has no real solutions. For <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1-\\frac12}{1+\\frac12}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln\\frac13.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech^2x=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech^2x=\\frac1{16}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth^2x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech^2x=9 \\Rightarrow\\cosech x=\\pm3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\ln\\left(\\frac13+\\sqrt{(\\frac13)^2+1}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{10}}3\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\ln\\left(-\\frac13+\\sqrt{(-\\frac13)^2+1}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{10}}3\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{10}}3\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{10}}3\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sech^2x=\\frac1{16} \\Rightarrow\\sech x=\\pm\\frac14.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\ln(4+\\sqrt{4^2-1})=\\ln(4+\\sqrt{15}).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=-\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the source gives</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{(-4)^2-1})=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{15}).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the source states <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(4+\\sqrt{15})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{15})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth^2x=3 \\Rightarrow\\coth x=\\pm\\sqrt3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{3+\\sqrt3}{3-\\sqrt3}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln(2+\\sqrt3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=-\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{3+\\sqrt3}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln(2-\\sqrt3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\\ln(2-\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech^2x+\\cosech x-20=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10\\sech^2x-9\\sech x+2=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\coth^2x-16\\coth x-64=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech^2x+\\cosech x-20=0 \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(\\cosech x+5)(\\cosech x-4) =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\cosech x =-5\\text{ or }\\cosech x=4.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=-\\frac15\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{26}}5\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{17}}4\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx=\\ln\\left(\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{26}}5\\right)\\text{ or }x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{17}}4\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n10\\sech^2x-9\\sech x+2=0 \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(5\\sech x-2)(2\\sech x-1) =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\sech x =\\frac25\\text{ or }\\sech x=\\frac12.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=\\frac25\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=\\frac52\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{5\\pm\\sqrt{21}}2\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sech x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(2\\pm\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac{5\\pm\\sqrt{21}}2\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(2\\pm\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3\\coth^2x-16\\coth x-64=0 \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(3\\coth x+8)(\\coth x-8) =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\coth x =-\\frac83\\text{ or }\\coth x=8.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=-\\frac83\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=-\\frac38\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\\ln\\frac5{11}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=\\frac18\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\\ln\\frac97\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\\ln\\frac5{11}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\\ln\\frac97\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>For each of the following functions, sketch the graph and state whether it is one-to-one or if it is many-to-one:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p><strong>Use set notation for the following questions which require a range of values.</strong></p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is one-to-one.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is many-to-one.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is one-to-one.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q20","number":20,"question":"<p>State the largest possible domain and range of the following functions:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" dat