"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where the domain is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 0&lt;y&lt;1\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where the domain is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y&gt;1\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q22","number":22,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following functions, stating their largest possible domain and range:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\cosech(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)=2+\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"h(x)=\\coth(x-1)-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne-3\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{f(x):f(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ f(x)\\ne0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{g(x):g(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 2&lt;g(x)\\leq3\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne1\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{h(x):h(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ h(x)&lt;-2\\}\\cup\\{h(x):h(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ h(x)&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q23","number":23,"question":"<p>State the largest possible domain and range for each of the following functions:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\cosech(x-2)+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)=3\\sech(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4+3\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"h(x)=\\coth(x+4)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\frac13\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\cosech(x-2)+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne2\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{f(x):f(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ f(x)\\ne2\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y\\ne2\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)=3\\sech(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{g(x):g(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 0&lt;g(x)\\leq3\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4+3\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 4&lt;y\\leq7\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"h(x)=\\coth(x+4)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne-4\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{h(x):h(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ h(x)&lt;-4\\}\\cup\\{h(x):h(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ h(x)&gt;-2\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\frac13\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y&lt;\\frac53\\}\\cup\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y&gt;\\frac73\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q24","number":24,"question":"<p>State the largest possible domain and range for each of the following functions:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ 0&lt;y\\leq1\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb R,\\ x\\ne0\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Range: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb R,\\ y&gt;1\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q25","number":25,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x+\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{ae^{bx}}{e^{cx}-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are real constants.</p></li><li><p>Hence explain why, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x+\\sech x&gt;\\dfrac{a}{e^{cx}-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosech x+\\sech x \\equiv\\frac2{e^x-e^{-x}}+\\frac2{e^x+e^{-x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{2e^x+2e^{-x}+2e^x-2e^{-x}}{e^{2x}-e^{-2x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{4e^x}{e^{2x}-e^{-2x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{4e^{3x}}{e^{4x}-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>For all <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{3x}&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{4e^{3x}}{e^{4x}-1}&gt;\\frac4{e^{4x}-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosech x+\\sech x&gt;\\frac4{e^{4x}-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q26","number":26,"question":"<p>Show clearly that, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x-\\tanh x&gt;4e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\coth x-\\tanh x \\equiv\\frac{\\cosh x}{\\sinh x}-\\frac{\\sinh x}{\\cosh x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{e^x-e^{-x}}-\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}{e^x+e^{-x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{(e^x+e^{-x})^2-(e^x-e^{-x})^2}{(e^x-e^{-x})(e^x+e^{-x})}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac{(e^{2x}+2+e^{-2x})-(e^{2x}-2+e^{-2x})}{e^{2x}-e^{-2x}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac4{e^{2x}-e^{-2x}}=\\frac{4e^{2x}}{e^{4x}-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>For <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{4x}&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{4e^{2x}}{e^{4x}-1}&gt;\\frac{4e^{2x}}{e^{4x}}=4e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x-\\tanh x&gt;4e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q27","number":27,"question":"<p>The graph below shows <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\cosech x+8\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.17/questions/assets/diagrams/217-q27.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Find the exact largest possible range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, writing your answer in set notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf(x) =\\cosech x+8\\sech x,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf'(x) =-\\cosech x\\coth x-8\\sech x\\tanh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac{\\cosh x}{\\sinh^2x}-\\frac{8\\sinh x}{\\cosh^2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{-\\cosh^3x-8\\sinh^3x}{\\sinh^2x\\cosh^2x}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Stationary points exist when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-\\cosh^3x-8\\sinh^3x =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-1-8\\tanh^3x =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\tanh^3x =-\\frac18\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\tanh x =-\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx =\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1-\\frac12}{1+\\frac12}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln\\frac13.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\\right) =\\cosech\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\\right)+8\\sech\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac2{1/\\sqrt3-\\sqrt3}+\\frac{16}{1/\\sqrt3+\\sqrt3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{2\\sqrt3}{1-3}+\\frac{16\\sqrt3}{1+3}=-\\sqrt3+4\\sqrt3=3\\sqrt3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Range is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{f(x):f(x)\\in\\mathbb R,\\ f(x)\\leq3\\sqrt3\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.17-q28","number":28,"question":"<p>The graph below shows <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\cosh x+\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.17/questions/assets/diagrams/217-q28.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Find the exact largest possible range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, writing your answer in interval notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf(x) =\\cosh x+\\coth x,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf'(x) =\\sinh x-\\cosech^2x=\\sinh x-\\frac1{\\sinh^2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{\\sinh^3x-1}{\\sinh^2x}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Stationary points exist when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sinh^3x-1 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sinh x =1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx =\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2+1})=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)) =\\cosh(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2))+\\coth(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{e^{\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}+e^{-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}}2+\\frac{e^{\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}+e^{-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}}{e^{\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}-e^{-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt2-1}{2}+\\frac{1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt2-1}{1+\\sqrt2-(\\sqrt2-1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\sqrt2+\\sqrt2=2\\sqrt2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Range is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\\in[2\\sqrt2,\\infty)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]